  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\bar{v}=\\mathrm{RZ}^2\\left(\\frac{1}{2^2}-\\frac{1}{3^2}\\right)$\n$$\n=\\mathrm{R}\\left(\\frac{1}{4}-\\frac{1}{9}\\right)=\\frac{5 \\mathrm{R}}{36}\n$$",
